{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COUNTERintuitive - The Roguelite Gambler</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective in COUNTERintuitive is to reach an ever-growing target score. Grow your pool and cash out until your bank reaches the target. Spend what's in your bank to purchase upgrades that will assist you in getting farther on future runs. Beat a target of one billion to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger with Every Attempt</strong><br>Earn permanent upgrades to increase your lives, cashouts, and bust limits, making each new run more forgiving than the last. Manage your pool, dodge busts, and outsmart the ever-climbing odds to hit your target and clear the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957420/extras/a07e750166ccf5635c81154c987214c0.avif?t=1756901292\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes, Simple Rules</strong><br>Add to your pool one step at a time\u2014or double it instantly at the risk of losing everything. Upgrade your stats, lower your bust chance, and push for bigger wins as the difficulty ramps up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957420/extras/9111673b8fac77b606e4b4641ab68956.avif?t=1756901292\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Edge with Mods</strong><br>Acquire unique mods that change the rules in your favor\u2014stack passive gains, cut upgrade costs, boost sell values, and more. Choose wisely, because every mod slot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957420/extras/7ce92ee960bd56a9b91900baeac427ad.avif?t=1756901292\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Millennium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/698fc5f582ba90c66cb299597c7c57028a137854.jpg"},{"name":"Aeon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/7e60b8c18f277d43e2f7bd2429938f6d782e385c.jpg"},{"name":"Tweaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/838483ffd43fd8fdc80bf61c13c18dd8996333e1.jpg"},{"name":"Curator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/4b0ac6a6f2e96890625f6bee15b410c99b725b2b.jpg"},{"name":"Richer Than I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/0cd0f25678ab5e599d498f57bee35956d150b7c1.jpg"},{"name":"Richer Than Most","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/29ecdf6aad3790152019c5b9a3a848c80e983663.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome To The 5%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/79db0d647700a4318759bf8ead247f3f24c1c3d7.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome To The 1%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/cd65a19c4b422f62685dc138eca1b2e876e5bd65.jpg"},{"name":"Still Not Close To A Billion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/28cf2407a6bb5001d6ff1a0c0710af88d0e9d1e0.jpg"},{"name":"To Infinity...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957420/62e2d9b73f1843a845198a7f7be8e992c2f5eed0.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957420?t=1756901292","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957420?t=1756901292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957420/e6282